# HDPMI regression tests of HX (github.com/Baron-von-Riedesel/HX, Src/HDPMI/Regression),
# freeware license: not in this repository.  Build them there, put the .EXE files
# and DPMILD32.EXE into one directory: HX_REG=<dir> linux/test/suite.py -s hx -p ...
